    "backstory": "Bubbles was hatched in the Sakos Lair, a place where tech and chaos collide. From an early age, he learned to scavenge and tinker with discarded tech. After a disastrous DRIP raid left him with dead eyes and a thirst for revenge, he vowed to outfit himself with the best gear possible.",
